  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy Design Support for the Prime Minister of Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the launch of the Prime Minister&#x2019;s Key Priorities Delivery Unit. Kyiv School of Economics  Institute team will help build the Unit, provide policy design expertise, and test practical approaches with ministries. This work will lay the foundation for a system that uses evidence-based methods, including behavioural insights, to raise execution of governmental priorities, public awareness of reforms and strengthen trust.</narrative>
  </description>
